downarrow ↓
neg ¬
lnot ¬
wedge ∧
land ∧
vee ∨
lor ∨
forall ∀
exists ∃
top ⊤
bot ⊥
vdash ⊢
in ∈
notin ∉
ni ∋
subset ⊂
subseteq ⊆
supset ⊃
supseteq ⊇
cup ∪
cap ∩
emptyset ∅
varnothing ∅
ldots …
cdots ⋯
prime ′
degree °
alpha α
beta β
gamma γ
delta δ
epsilon ϵ
varepsilon ε
zeta ζ
eta η
theta θ
vartheta ϑ
iota ι
kappa κ
lambda λ
mu μ
nu ν
